#################################################################
 Data Analyses - Step by Step
#################################################################


1) Merge raw data into one file using E-Merge. Save merged file as rawDataMerge TSV-file.

2) Data cleansing using the Python Files "Data preparation" and "util". Data cleansing to be carried out separately for matching task and dot-probe task data.
Save data as LST-files.

3) Import LST-files into SPSS and analyse the data using the SPSS Syntax File.